"The gods of Larrean were once mortal humans who overthrew the old pantheon and took its seats."
"The gods of Larrean demand their mortal origin stay secret, lest mortals seek to become gods."
"An alcove in Maradoc's House of Many Gates opens a portal to Viv's home world."
"Emeric fled through Maradoc's portal into Viv's old body, and came back through it this winter."
"At war's end Maradoc pushed Maranor through his portal into Viv's home world, exiling her."
"Before her exile Maranor cut off her own arm, tainted by the dead god Khaton, with the Slayer."
